	Nowadays, university libraries open to the public have arouse generous aruguments. Opinions vary from person to person. As far as I am concerned, university libraries shouldn't 
open to the public, which may bring unpredictable cases.
	For one thing, plenty of strangers that don't be identified have possibility to hit the security of students.  The college students are most of that never experience the society
